/dist/
/aipocket
*.exe
.env

# Claude Code local settings — personal, must not be published. The glob covers
# the atomic-write temp files too (settings.local.json.tmp.<pid>.<hash>): they
# exist for a few milliseconds, which is long enough for a `git add -A` to catch
# one, and they are a full copy of the settings including local paths.
.claude/settings.local.json*
